#lang rzk-1

-- A modal field whose domain is a type is rejected: unlike a cube or shape
-- field, a type field can be recursive, and the recursion and positivity
-- bookkeeping does not see through a modal binder. The decision is made on
-- the elaborated constructor type (checkDataConFieldLayers), since on the
-- surface (x :_b Unit) is indistinguishable from a named modal shape field.
#data Wrap := wrap (x :_b Unit)
